									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/moksydoesstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158962); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607413971" alt="Moksydoesstuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158962)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/moksydoesstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158962); return false;" >Moksydoesstuff</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607411204 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">08 Dec 2020 07:06</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13898227/friendship-bracelet-seeking-greenlight">Friendship bracelet seeking greenlight</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839412">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An anomalous bracelet which removes the wearers ability to experience any and all negative emotions. This bracelet then compels its wearer to create &quot;friendship bracelets&quot; out of available materials and attempts to convince others to wear these bracelets. the original bracelet changes size in order to always fit its wearer, the other bracelets created by an affected person have all the same effects excluding this one.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The story will be told through an interview log of an agent who was sent as part of a pair to investigate a quickly growing cult. The cult was in possession of the original bracelet and all of its members were wearing other instances. The agent will have been tortured, along with their partner dying to the torture, and was recovered along with the SCP when an MTF was deployed.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The story is an exploration of the implications of a person (or group of people) having a single goal that consumes their life. This exploration is diversified by the individuals not having negative emotions (which lead to morals) to &quot;hold them back&quot;.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I have a draft of the SCP article, and would like tweaks before I write the interview.</p>

